      "message": "fix(ui): Windows start-up box only for panics that escape run (#1325)\n\nDrop the global panic hook; main wraps run in catch_unwind on Windows. A failed\nCONOUT$ open after a successful attach counts as no console. Payload-to-text\nlives in panic_text.rs with a unit test.\n\nFixes #1325\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
